WEBVTT

00:01:46.398 --> 00:01:47.982
Don't collapse yet.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:52.529
The execution isn't over
until your head rolls.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.448
Finish him.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:56.366
Right...

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:00.912
Gum chewer?

00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:11.715
I just need to hit your
partner's left knee, right?

00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:17.387
Then Yukimura-<i>kun </i>can get the surgery
he needs to cure his illness in the States.

00:02:18.013 --> 00:02:20.348
Yes, I promise.

00:02:24.394 --> 00:02:26.229
I'll do it.

00:02:29.441 --> 00:02:30.775
My kneecap...

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:31.985
My kneecap!

00:02:32.235 --> 00:02:34.654
Marui-<i>san </i>hit his knee!

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:37.907
The Executioner looks
out of his mind with pain.

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:43.496
Forty-fifteen.

00:02:44.706 --> 00:02:46.958
The match isn't over yet.

00:02:48.418 --> 00:02:51.588
Of course, I've won it already, though.

00:02:53.423 --> 00:02:55.091
Game and match, first string!

00:02:55.091 --> 00:02:57.677
Kimijima-Tono pair, two sets to zero!

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:01.598
Six games to three, six games to two!

00:03:04.809 --> 00:03:06.603
Let go!

00:03:06.603 --> 00:03:08.855
I can make it to the medical office myself!

00:03:10.315 --> 00:03:15.779
He clung to his U-17 national team
pin more than any other.

00:03:16.613 --> 00:03:19.699
This won't be the last we see of him.

00:03:23.161 --> 00:03:23.620
Hello.

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:27.207
Please go on with that affair immediately.

00:03:29.501 --> 00:03:30.543
Bunta Marui-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:34.214
I'll keep my promise.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:38.385
Someone should contact
him within a few days.

00:03:42.806 --> 00:03:46.267
I never would've guessed he
had negotiated with you, too.

00:03:46.935 --> 00:03:50.146
We'll play doubles again, right, Kiteretsu?

00:03:50.522 --> 00:03:52.649
I've had enough of doubles.

00:03:53.525 --> 00:03:56.778
This hardly makes up for it, but...

00:03:57.362 --> 00:04:00.156
Could I have a stick of gum instead?

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:01.574
Okay.

00:04:02.867 --> 00:04:08.873
"Embrace the Ten Ball Strike and Sleep"

00:04:09.165 --> 00:04:11.418
What? Akutsu-<i>san</i>'s missing?

00:04:12.293 --> 00:04:13.962
That's odd.

00:04:14.796 --> 00:04:17.090
He was sitting over there just a minute ago.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.383
What are we going to do?

00:04:18.383 --> 00:04:20.510
He's supposed to play in the next match!

00:04:24.305 --> 00:04:26.224
The fool.

00:04:26.224 --> 00:04:29.227
And I'd prepared a place for him to die...

00:04:29.644 --> 00:04:31.104
Hey, Mister Oni!

00:04:33.189 --> 00:04:35.066
You're my prey!

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:36.901
Kin-<i>chan</i>...

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.363
Very well.

00:04:41.448 --> 00:04:43.908
I will play you once more.

00:04:45.869 --> 00:04:47.829
Thanks, mister!

00:04:49.456 --> 00:04:54.544
The fourth match is the U-17
Japanese team's No. 5, Jujiroh Oni,

00:04:54.544 --> 00:04:57.881
versus the second string's Kintaro Toyama.

00:04:58.923 --> 00:05:00.675
Best of three set match!

00:05:00.925 --> 00:05:03.219
Toyama to serve!

00:05:04.262 --> 00:05:06.014
Get him, Kin-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:06.473 --> 00:05:09.100
Watch out for his Black Jack Knife!

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:12.395
All right! Here we go!

00:05:14.356 --> 00:05:19.819
Super Megaton Wonder
Deluxe Volcano Serve!

00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:24.407
This is...

00:05:29.537 --> 00:05:30.705
He reached the ball?

00:05:31.956 --> 00:05:35.126
You look like you're standing still, Mister Oni.

00:05:38.254 --> 00:05:38.838
What?

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.257
Kin-<i>chan </i>hit a drop shot?

00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:43.677
Fifteen-love!

00:05:51.059 --> 00:05:53.812
Power, speed, technique...

00:05:53.812 --> 00:05:57.524
I'm surprised he's grown this much!

00:05:59.776 --> 00:06:00.777
Game, second string!

00:06:00.777 --> 00:06:02.112
One game to love!

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:07.033
Are these the results of his
training on top of the cliff?

00:06:08.243 --> 00:06:10.453
He took a game off Oni-<i>san</i>!

00:06:13.123 --> 00:06:19.170
He's been hiding that power
until he faced me again?

00:06:22.173 --> 00:06:23.216
Game, second string!

00:06:23.216 --> 00:06:24.592
Three games to love!

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:28.763
They say the wise eagle hides its talons!

00:06:29.139 --> 00:06:31.057
It's "hawk!"

00:06:38.273 --> 00:06:41.026
That's Oni-<i>san</i>'s Five Ball Strike!

00:06:48.033 --> 00:06:50.118
Kin-<i>chan </i>returned all five!

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:57.375
He's returning the Five Ball Strike so easily...

00:06:57.834 --> 00:06:58.918
Well, well.

00:07:01.755 --> 00:07:04.758
This is nothing!

00:07:05.175 --> 00:07:08.511
Good! You pass! Now try to keep up!

00:07:08.887 --> 00:07:10.180
Six balls!

00:07:11.556 --> 00:07:13.350
I'm getting excited!

00:07:13.683 --> 00:07:16.269
What is that? He upped it to six!

00:07:17.645 --> 00:07:18.313
No...

00:07:19.397 --> 00:07:20.482
It's seven!

00:07:25.737 --> 00:07:26.946
Eight balls?

00:07:31.785 --> 00:07:34.204
H-He's still going?

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:38.041
Nine balls!

00:07:49.511 --> 00:07:51.513
Stop! He can't handle any more!

00:07:57.811 --> 00:08:03.274
Are you trying to destroy the boy
you trained by your own hand, Oni?

00:08:08.279 --> 00:08:10.115
Embrace the Ten Ball Strike and sleep!

00:08:10.865 --> 00:08:12.492
That's ten balls!

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:14.452
Run!

00:08:16.871 --> 00:08:17.956
Kin-<i>chan</i>...

00:08:20.959 --> 00:08:22.711
First ball!

00:08:23.003 --> 00:08:23.878
Kintaro!

00:08:25.088 --> 00:08:26.798
Second!

00:08:27.966 --> 00:08:29.926
Third!

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:33.221
Fourth!

00:08:34.806 --> 00:08:36.307
Fifth!

00:08:40.562 --> 00:08:42.439
Sixth!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.650
Seventh!

00:08:48.945 --> 00:08:50.780
Eight!

00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:54.075
Nine!

00:09:01.082 --> 00:09:02.000
I will...

00:09:03.001 --> 00:09:08.423
I will become the best
tennis player in Japan!

00:09:12.635 --> 00:09:13.803
The net...

00:09:14.471 --> 00:09:16.014
It caught fire!

00:09:36.034 --> 00:09:39.537
You've finally unleashed your potential.

00:09:49.839 --> 00:09:50.382
Hey.

00:09:50.965 --> 00:09:52.050
Hey!

00:09:53.885 --> 00:09:55.720
Did you really need to use the bathroom?

00:09:56.137 --> 00:09:58.640
That's what I said, Shorty.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:01.142
Really? That's no fun.

00:10:02.977 --> 00:10:05.271
You've got a visitor.

00:10:07.148 --> 00:10:08.274
Akutsu-<i>san</i>?

00:10:08.983 --> 00:10:10.902
Should you be here?

00:10:11.444 --> 00:10:15.073
Some guy named Oni was really
looking forward to your match.

00:10:16.116 --> 00:10:17.701
That's irrelevant.

00:10:17.701 --> 00:10:22.580
I have no interest in playing
for Japan's U-17 team.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:23.498
All I have

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.459
is a favor to repay to that kid!

00:10:27.711 --> 00:10:28.920
Good luck with that.

00:10:32.007 --> 00:10:34.843
Too bad. Looks like he rejected you.

00:10:35.927 --> 00:10:38.888
If you want, I'll teach you how to play.

00:10:39.389 --> 00:10:40.765
Get on the court.

00:10:42.392 --> 00:10:44.936
Don't order me around.

00:10:54.487 --> 00:10:57.073
I bet you think you've dodged all ten...

00:10:59.075 --> 00:10:59.784
But it's futile!

00:11:07.292 --> 00:11:09.127
Bring it on!

00:11:09.127 --> 00:11:10.628
Don't make me laugh!

00:11:11.713 --> 00:11:13.840
Is this all you can do?

00:11:16.217 --> 00:11:17.677
I'm just getting started.

00:11:32.609 --> 00:11:35.653
Kin-<i>chan</i>'s returning ten balls
without breaking a sweat.

00:11:36.196 --> 00:11:37.614
You can do it, Kin-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:38.031 --> 00:11:39.949
Don't think too hard.

00:11:39.949 --> 00:11:43.036
Just show him your
instinctive style, Kin-<i>chan</i>.

00:11:43.828 --> 00:11:44.954
Winner takes all!

00:11:51.336 --> 00:11:57.133
I will become the best
tennis player in Japan!

00:11:57.717 --> 00:12:01.429
The best tennis player in Japan, huh?

00:12:27.455 --> 00:12:29.374
"Social Welfare Corporation"
"Warm Alley"

00:12:32.752 --> 00:12:37.507
Let's see. What do those kids want?

00:12:37.882 --> 00:12:41.845
Well, all I've got are my special
hand-knitted Oni-<i>san </i>toys...

00:12:44.431 --> 00:12:48.852
Mister Oni, become the best
tennis player in Japan!

00:12:50.687 --> 00:12:53.189
I wanted to become stronger than anyone

00:12:53.857 --> 00:12:56.401
so I could see the kids smile.

00:12:57.444 --> 00:13:00.780
I trained to become the best in Japan...

00:13:01.489 --> 00:13:04.701
You can do it, Mister Oni!

00:13:05.326 --> 00:13:11.082
And then I was invited to the
U-17 national team training camp.

00:13:14.085 --> 00:13:16.963
You look pretty old for a high schooler.

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:20.383
I'm Jujiroh Oni.

00:13:21.801 --> 00:13:23.803
Houoh Byodoin.

00:13:46.034 --> 00:13:51.247
M-Mister Oni's shots suddenly feel heavier.

00:13:51.247 --> 00:13:52.540
Does that feel heavy?

00:13:53.708 --> 00:13:54.751
Mister?

00:13:55.669 --> 00:13:58.546
You'll become the best
tennis player in Japan?

00:13:59.005 --> 00:14:04.678
How much weight do those
words you spoke truly carry?

00:14:07.013 --> 00:14:09.683
I will be the judge!

00:14:11.267 --> 00:14:13.186
S-Sounds fun!

00:14:13.186 --> 00:14:16.731
I'll show you what I can really do!

00:14:22.779 --> 00:14:24.948
N-No way...

00:14:36.501 --> 00:14:38.086
What was that?

00:14:38.086 --> 00:14:40.505
Did you see something
that looked like an ogre?

00:14:44.217 --> 00:14:48.346
My old scar aches today.

00:14:49.556 --> 00:14:54.436
The Oni who beat me two years ago is back.

00:15:02.152 --> 00:15:04.529
Game and first set, first string's Oni!

00:15:04.779 --> 00:15:06.448
Six games to three!

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:14.372
Dang. I can't even react
to Mister Oni's shots...

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:21.338
Did Oni-<i>senpai </i>really beat the
first string's Byodoin-<i>senpai</i>?

00:15:22.547 --> 00:15:24.549
I've heard that story, too.

00:15:25.425 --> 00:15:26.468
Two years ago,

00:15:26.468 --> 00:15:31.723
Oni and Byodoin fought soon after
they arrived at this training camp.

00:15:46.738 --> 00:15:47.989
Oni won.

00:15:48.948 --> 00:15:52.160
Byodoin was sent to train above the cliff.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:56.206
He swore to beat Oni and
trained as hard as he could.

00:15:56.915 --> 00:16:01.419
When he returned, he had gained
incomparable strength.

00:16:02.295 --> 00:16:08.343
Meanwhile, as a first year, Oni was
the strongest on the U-17 national team.

00:16:09.552 --> 00:16:13.348
Standing at the top with
no one left to battle head-on,

00:16:13.348 --> 00:16:18.353
he began training others and raising
the national team's standards.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:24.067
Then he became the Gatekeeper of Court 5

00:16:24.067 --> 00:16:27.320
and waited for the new generation to rise.

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:31.449
Game, first string!

00:16:31.449 --> 00:16:33.326
Three games to love, Oni!

00:16:36.621 --> 00:16:38.248
D-Damn!

00:16:38.748 --> 00:16:41.418
Are you done counterattacking, Kintaro?

00:16:44.379 --> 00:16:45.880
What's wrong?

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:49.426
Aren't you going to become the
best tennis player in Japan?

00:16:52.804 --> 00:16:55.515
No one likes a stubborn guy, you know!

00:16:56.683 --> 00:16:58.685
That's fine with me!

00:17:00.603 --> 00:17:01.855
Oh, really?

00:17:05.025 --> 00:17:05.942
Kid!

00:17:18.204 --> 00:17:20.999
Akutsu-<i>san</i>, could you move?

00:17:22.459 --> 00:17:24.502
I've decided to play him after all.

00:17:25.378 --> 00:17:29.591
I see you've got the same
competitive spirit you had as a kid.

00:17:30.508 --> 00:17:32.761
Do you want to play or not?

00:17:33.136 --> 00:17:34.971
Hey, kid!

00:17:34.971 --> 00:17:36.681
He picked this fight with <i>me</i>!

00:17:37.057 --> 00:17:38.600
Stay out of it!

00:17:39.893 --> 00:17:43.438
You fools! That's enough!

00:17:44.397 --> 00:17:47.108
Looks like we're being interrupted.

00:17:48.443 --> 00:17:50.236
Come, Jin Akutsu.

00:17:51.654 --> 00:17:54.157
Who do you think you're
ordering around, Sanada?

00:17:54.157 --> 00:17:55.700
I'll split your head open!

00:17:56.743 --> 00:17:58.536
You're playing doubles

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:01.122
with me in the next match.

00:18:08.546 --> 00:18:09.631
Game, first string!

00:18:09.631 --> 00:18:10.924
Five games to love!

00:18:13.593 --> 00:18:16.596
Has the fire in your heart gone out?

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.103
Is this the end of the line?

00:18:23.561 --> 00:18:26.022
This isn't like you, Kin-<i>chan</i>!

00:18:27.482 --> 00:18:30.485
You did well, Kintaro Toyama.

00:18:31.653 --> 00:18:33.947
I'm more than excited.

00:18:34.572 --> 00:18:36.866
I'm beyond thrilled.

00:18:37.158 --> 00:18:38.284
Kin-<i>chan</i>.

00:18:38.827 --> 00:18:42.997
My heart is pounding.

00:18:42.997 --> 00:18:46.626
This is fun. Way too fun.

00:18:46.626 --> 00:18:50.171
That's why I can't stop playing tennis!

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.219
Th-This kid...

00:18:56.636 --> 00:18:58.888
What is that? Could it be...

00:18:59.472 --> 00:19:02.809
Kin-<i>chan</i>'s finally achieved...

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.854
...the Pinnacle of Perfection.

00:19:16.239 --> 00:19:18.074
The Pinnacle of Perfection...

00:19:18.491 --> 00:19:21.494
I knew Kin-<i>chan </i>would make it someday.

00:19:21.911 --> 00:19:25.123
I can feel his pure joy for tennis,

00:19:25.874 --> 00:19:27.417
even in my own heart.

00:19:28.793 --> 00:19:29.836
Thirty-love!

00:19:30.628 --> 00:19:32.756
Oni can't react.

00:19:33.048 --> 00:19:36.760
Mister, it's no fun if you
don't return the ball!

00:19:39.012 --> 00:19:40.055
You're right.

00:19:41.848 --> 00:19:43.433
He returned it!

00:19:44.059 --> 00:19:48.313
Is Oni impervious to the
Pinnacle of Perfection, too?

00:19:48.313 --> 00:19:49.397
Impossible...

00:19:49.814 --> 00:19:52.817
No, Kin-<i>chan</i>'s smiling.

00:19:54.194 --> 00:19:56.404
You've got me riled up, Mister Oni!

00:19:56.404 --> 00:19:57.739
You're awesome!

00:19:58.323 --> 00:20:01.993
Kintaro Toyama, you're a strange one.

00:20:02.535 --> 00:20:05.413
I'm lucky to have faced you.

00:20:05.997 --> 00:20:07.290
Thank you.

00:20:07.749 --> 00:20:08.667
Now...

00:20:09.626 --> 00:20:12.462
Let's have some fun together, Kintaro!

00:20:12.462 --> 00:20:14.964
O-Oni-<i>san</i>'s reached the
Pinnacle of Perfection, too?

00:20:16.049 --> 00:20:18.009
Here we go, mister!

00:20:18.009 --> 00:20:19.511
No holding back!

00:20:19.969 --> 00:20:21.513
Of course!

00:20:26.309 --> 00:20:30.397
Had Oni-<i>san </i>achieved the Pinnacle
of Perfection from the start?

00:20:30.397 --> 00:20:31.398
No,

00:20:31.398 --> 00:20:34.067
playing against Toyama-<i>kun </i>triggered it.

00:20:34.067 --> 00:20:38.571
He regained the strength
and goal he'd forgotten.

00:20:39.322 --> 00:20:42.242
His matches against you
guys must have helped, too.

00:20:42.659 --> 00:20:44.661
He's trying to make us feel better.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.497
Leave me alone.

00:20:47.497 --> 00:20:49.040
Either way,

00:20:49.958 --> 00:20:50.917
that boy...

00:20:52.419 --> 00:20:53.962
...has a great expression on his face.

00:20:56.589 --> 00:20:58.216
Game and match, first string!

00:20:58.216 --> 00:21:00.176
Jujiroh Oni wins!

00:21:00.176 --> 00:21:03.221
Six games to three, six games to one!

00:21:03.722 --> 00:21:04.514
Huh?

00:21:04.889 --> 00:21:05.932
It's already over?

00:21:06.307 --> 00:21:09.894
Why?! I wanted to play more!

00:21:09.894 --> 00:21:11.187
This sucks!

00:21:12.772 --> 00:21:15.025
Kin-<i>chan</i>'s unbelievable...

00:21:17.652 --> 00:21:21.072
I had fun, mister. Thanks.

00:21:21.072 --> 00:21:23.033
Become stronger.

00:21:23.033 --> 00:21:24.451
I look forward to seeing it.

00:21:24.826 --> 00:21:27.746
Next time, you won't beat me!

00:21:31.249 --> 00:21:34.711
Shorty, you did a good job saving him.

00:21:34.711 --> 00:21:35.920
What do you mean?

00:21:37.005 --> 00:21:38.298
Anyway...

00:21:39.215 --> 00:21:44.220
Will you teach me how to
hit that glowing shot?

00:23:18.398 --> 00:23:20.567
"Next Time"

00:23:20.567 --> 00:23:22.736
"Next Time"
Akutsu, did you hydrate before our match?

00:23:22.736 --> 00:23:24.070
Akutsu, did you hydrate before our match?

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:26.031
Don't order me around.

00:23:26.031 --> 00:23:27.907
--Don't you know how important it is to--

00:23:27.907 --> 00:23:29.075
--Shut up!
--Don't you know how important it is to--

00:23:29.075 --> 00:23:30.452
How dare you?!

00:23:30.452 --> 00:23:32.037
We learned about this in science class!

00:23:32.037 --> 00:23:34.456
Roughly 60% of our bodies are water--

00:23:34.456 --> 00:23:38.293
The next episode of <i>New Prince of Tennis</i>
is: "The Emperor and the Monster."

00:23:38.293 --> 00:23:40.462
You shouldn't be here, Senpai!

00:23:42.005 --> 00:23:44.466
"The Emperor and the Monster"
Shouldn't the episode's title be
"The Square and the Monster"?

00:23:44.466 --> 00:23:48.480
"The Emperor and the Monster"
